      "widgets_values": [
        "the standing woman in blue who is holding and eating the popsicle",
        "Replace her entire visible person with the woman from the loaded reference images. Follow the source video frame by frame: preserve her standing pose, body sway, head turns, gaze, expression timing, arm, hand, finger, and mouth movements. Keep the popsicle interaction and timing exactly as recorded, including her grip, raising it, mouth contact, eating motion, and moving it away. Keep the original popsicle with natural hand, finger, lip, and mouth contact.",
        "Keep the original outdoor scene, camera movement and approach, framing, perspective, timing, lighting, shadows, street, background, objects, and cuts unchanged. Keep the seated woman in red and the man unchanged. The target woman must leave the frame at the same moment as in the source video.",
        "Use the loaded reference images only for the replacement woman’s appearance: body proportions from the body reference; facial identity from the face reference; brown outfit, long dark hair, glasses, and tattoos from the outfit references. Keep her body build and face stable. Do not copy the black outfit or white background from the body reference. Avoid flicker, morphing, identity drift, distorted mouth, deformed hands, and changes to her clothing or proportions.",
        "popsicle\nseated woman wearing red\nman"
      ]
